contentText:
Number_i&#8217;s &#8220;BUGS LIFE&#8221; bows at No. 1 on the Billboard Japan Hot 100, on the chart dated July 22.

The digital single dropped July 13 and launches at No. 1 for downloads and radio airplay, while hitting No. 2 for video views and No. 11 for streaming. The track gives the trio its sixth chart-topper and eighth week at No. 1 on the Japan Hot 100.

